      "summary_html": "<p>Anthropic\u2019s IPO has united AI safety advocates and accelerationists around an unlikely concern. If a company gains the kind of influence we associate with a government, what does it owe the public? This Long Read Sunday explores the debate over Anthropic\u2019s power, why some in tech would welcome handing control to AI, and what happens when businesses give agents a goal and let them decide how to reach it.</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>LATEST EPISODE: How We Got Here - 'How GTA 6 Explains America\"</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-gta-6-explains-america/id6822359990?i=1000802247758\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-gta-6-explains-america/id6822359990?i=1000802247758\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/5rpX1oN6jNEVFuHZxJKIBA?si=WN-AKw8NQHKLLExAHXtIIQ\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://open.spotify.com/episode/5rpX1oN6jNEVFuHZxJKIBA?si=WN-AKw8NQHKLLExAHXtIIQ\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>Brought to you by:</strong></p><p><strong>KPMG</strong> \u2013 New KPMG and UT Austin research shows what separates \u201cAI Amplifiers\u201d from everyone else. Learn more at <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/us/en/articles/2026/ai-redefining-career-success-empower-your-talent-thrive.html?utm_source=the_ai_daily_brief&amp;utm_medium=native&amp;utm_content=podcast&amp;utm_campaign=701dV00000aMKrPQAW&amp;cid=701dV00000aMKrPQAW\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060kpmg.com/us/AIamplifiers\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Gartner</strong> - AI strategy, trends and insights - <a href=\"https://www.gartner.com/ai\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060h